        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The blades are deep blue; planted thickly on clouds they can make those clouds look blue from below. Fang Yuan plants large plots on dark clouds in Hu Immortal blessed land instead of buying bulk cloud soil.",
